sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: Similar solid numbers have to one another the ratio which a cubic number has to a cubic number.
----
proof:

Let {A} and {B} be similar solid numbers.

I say that {A} has to {B} the ratio which cubic number has to cubic number.

